color:black'>deme yap</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Times","serif";
mso-ascii-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>ı</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>lmaz.</span><span
